<Portfolio title="Small business website cost in Dubai" description="Compare Under the Haik website packages in Dubai: launch and regular prices, included revisions, domain setup, care and separately quoted extras.">
<article class="service-document guide-body wrap"><h1>How much does a small business website cost in Dubai?</h1><p>A useful quote starts with what the website needs to do. A single page explaining one service has a different scope from several service pages, a booking system or a shop. The prices below are Under the Haik’s packages, rather than an estimate of every provider in Dubai.</p><h2>Website packages and launch prices</h2><div class="cost-table-scroll"><table class="cost-table"><caption>Current 50% launch offer; provider charges and extras are separate.</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Package</th><th scope="col">Regular</th><th scope="col">Launch</th><th scope="col">Scope</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a href={url('services/one-page-website-dubai/')}>One-page website</a></th><td>650 AED</td><td>325 AED</td><td>Up to six sections, one revision round</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href={url('services/web-design-dubai/')}>Business website</a></th><td>1,200 AED</td><td>600 AED</td><td>Up to five simple pages, two revision rounds</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Website + identity</th><td>1,550 AED</td><td>775 AED</td><td>Business website and starter visual identity</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href={url('services/website-branding-package-dubai/')}>Complete launch</a></th><td>1,700 AED</td><td>850 AED</td><td>Business website, identity and social setup</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Complete launch + domain setup</th><td>1,900 AED</td><td>950 AED</td><td>Complete launch with first-year domain setup</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>These packages cover static websites in one language using client-supplied text and photographs. They include responsive design, basic SEO setup and the stated revision rounds. We agree the design direction and final scope in writing before work starts.</p><h2>What can change the total?</h2><p>An additional simple page using the approved design is 200 AED. An additional website revision round is 150 AED for up to one hour. A second-language version starts from 50% of the website build price with client-supplied translations. Third-party booking or form integration starts from 150 AED, with subscriptions charged separately.</p><p>Custom checkout, user accounts, booking systems, extensive animation and copywriting need a separate quote. A portfolio shop concept is not a promise that those features are included in a simple website package.</p><h2>Domain, hosting and ownership</h2><p>Standalone domain and hosting setup is 200 AED for year one. It includes a domain registration allowance up to 75 AED, domain connection, HTTPS and setup on a suitable free static hosting tier. Higher domain purchase costs and paid hosting are additional and agreed before buying. The domain is registered in your name.</p><h2>Costs after launch</h2><p>You receive the agreed files and account access, with 14 days of corrections for faults in the agreed work. Content changes are separate. Pay-as-you-go changes start at 100 AED for up to 30 minutes, then 75 AED per additional 30 minutes. Monthly Website Care is 150 AED, or 300 AED for Care Plus; these standard rates are not discounted by the launch offer.</p><p>Renewal management is 100 AED per year plus provider charges. The management fee is waived for active monthly care clients; provider charges remain payable. See <a href={url('services/website-care-uae/')}>website care options</a> for update allowances and terms.</p><h2>A short checklist before requesting a quote</h2><ol><li>List your services and the action visitors should take.</li><li>Choose the pages or sections you need.</li><li>Gather your logo, text and photographs.</li><li>Identify forms, languages and integrations.</li><li>Share your budget and preferred launch date.</li></ol><p>The proposed payment split is 50% to begin and 50% before handover. Payment, cancellation and ownership terms are stated in the written quote. Compare the <a href={url('#services')}>full package list</a> or explore a service below.</p><nav class="service-links" aria-label="Related services">{services.map(service => <a href={url(`services/${service.slug}/`)}>{service.label}</a>)}</nav><a class="button" href="#contact">Request a quote ↗</a></article><PortfolioContact/>
</Portfolio>
